  "description": "Forest presence or absence in 2020 at 1/12000 degree (about 10 m), following the FAO forest definition that the EU Deforestation Regulation also uses. Produced by the European Commission Joint Research Centre (JRC), version 4, and mirrored unchanged from the JRC JEODPP server by Epoch as one global COG. The current version; it supersedes the deprecated version 3 (collection `forest-cover-2020-v3`) on the same grid. See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for a tested access recipe.",
